{"seq":3,"slug":"esg-data-quality-gap-metric","title":"ESG 数据完整率/缺口与改进度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/esg-scope3-sustainability-reporting/esg-report-ops/esg-data-quality-gap-metric","wordCount":2698,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"esg-数据完整率-缺口与改进度量\">ESG 数据完整率/缺口与改进度量</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>披露体系如果不能度量自己的完成度，就只能靠年底的焦虑来判断风险。度量的目的不是给报告打一个漂亮分数，而是回答几个具体的管理问题：<strong>本期应采集的数据点里实际拿到了多少、其中多少是实测多少是估算、有多少供应商根本没有响应、鉴证提出的调整项比上期是增是减</strong>。这四个问题的答案，决定了下一年的资源投向。</p>\n<p>度量的第一个技术难点是<strong>定义分母</strong>。「完整率」看似直观，实则取决于如何界定「应采集」。分母定得太宽（把全部 ESRS 披露点都算上）会让完整率永远很低且无行动指导；定得太窄（只算当年实际试过收集的）会让完整率虚高且掩盖盲区。可行的折中是按主题矩阵裁定的适用披露点作为分母，见 <a href=\"../esg-disclosure-framework/double-materiality-assessment\">双重重要性评估与主题矩阵</a>——这也让「不适用」的判定有了第二重价值：它既减少采集工作，也让完整率的分母可解释。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[适用披露点分母&lt;br/&gt;来自主题矩阵] --&gt; B[实得数据点分子]&#10;  A --&gt; C[缺口 = 分母 - 分子]&#10;  B --&gt; D[按数据质量分层&lt;br/&gt;L1实测 / L2计算 / L3代理 / L4支出]&#10;  B --&gt; E[按覆盖实体分层&lt;br/&gt;场址 / 采购额]&#10;  C --&gt; F[缺口分类]&#10;  F --&gt; G[未采集&lt;br/&gt;能力缺口]&#10;  F --&gt; H[已请求未回收&lt;br/&gt;执行缺口]&#10;  F --&gt; I[不可得&lt;br/&gt;客观限制]&#10;  D --&gt; J[改进优先级排序]&#10;  E --&gt; J&#10;  G --&gt; J&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[下一年任务模板与目标]\">graph TD\n  A[适用披露点分母&lt;br/&gt;来自主题矩阵] --&gt; B[实得数据点分子]\n  A --&gt; C[缺口 = 分母 - 分子]\n  B --&gt; D[按数据质量分层&lt;br/&gt;L1实测 / L2计算 / L3代理 / L4支出]\n  B --&gt; E[按覆盖实体分层&lt;br/&gt;场址 / 采购额]\n  C --&gt; F[缺口分类]\n  F --&gt; G[未采集&lt;br/&gt;能力缺口]\n  F --&gt; H[已请求未回收&lt;br/&gt;执行缺口]\n  F --&gt; I[不可得&lt;br/&gt;客观限制]\n  D --&gt; J[改进优先级排序]\n  E --&gt; J\n  G --&gt; J\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[下一年任务模板与目标]</pre><p>图里 F 到 I 的三个分类是关键：<strong>缺口的原因不同，动作不同</strong>。未采集是能力问题（要建通道），已请求未回收是执行问题（要换杠杆），不可得是客观限制（要改方法或披露局限）。把三者混成一个「完整率 68%」的数字，等于没有信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心指标的定义\">核心指标的定义</h2><h3 id=\"数据完整率\">数据完整率</h3><p>最基础的一层。定义方式有两种，各有适用场景：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>完整率</mtext><mtext>点数</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>已获得有效值的数据点数</mtext><mtext>适用披露点数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{完整率}_{\\text{点数}} = \\frac{\\text{已获得有效值的数据点数}}{\\text{适用披露点数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">完整率</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">点数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">适用披露点数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已获得有效值的数据点数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>完整率</mtext><mtext>覆盖</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>已覆盖的采购额（或场址数）</mtext><mtext>应覆盖的采购额（或场址数）</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{完整率}_{\\text{覆盖}} = \\frac{\\text{已覆盖的采购额（或场址数）}}{\\text{应覆盖的采购额（或场址数）}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">完整率</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">覆盖</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应覆盖的采购额（或场址数）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已覆盖的采购额（或场址数）</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对价值链数据（范围 3 类别 1、社会 S2），点数口径会失真——一个数据点可能只覆盖一个供应商。因此<strong>覆盖口径在这两类上更有效</strong>，而自有运营数据（范围 1/2、S1）用点数口径即可。</p>\n<h3 id=\"估算占比与数据质量分布\">估算占比与数据质量分布</h3><p>一个只报完整率的体系会鼓励用估算填满缺口。因此完整率必须与估算占比一起看。这一对指标之所以必须并列，是因为数据质量的分级本身是国际核算体系的核心议题：GHG Protocol 的企业标准覆盖《京都议定书》七种气体，其核心原则是相关性、完整性、一致性、透明性与准确性，其中「透明度」与「准确性」直接对应估算占比的可解释性（<a href=\"https://ghgprotocol.org/corporate-standard\">GHG Protocol，Corporate Standard</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>估算占比</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>标记为 L3/L4 的排放量</mtext><mtext>总排放量</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{估算占比} = \\frac{\\text{标记为 L3/L4 的排放量}}{\\text{总排放量}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">估算占比</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总排放量</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">标记为</span><span class=\"mord\"> L3/L4 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的排放量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对排放类指标用<strong>排放量加权</strong>而不是点数加权，因为一个占比极小的数据点用估算没关系，而占排放 40% 的类别全靠估算则是实质问题。这个定义直接对接鉴证的风险评估——估算占比高的指标是鉴证重点，见 <a href=\"../assurance-governance/limited-reasonable-assurance\">有限保证/合理保证鉴证</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"供应商响应率\">供应商响应率</h3><p>价值链数据的前置指标。定义要区分<strong>发出、响应、通过校验</strong>三态，只看「响应率」会高估可用数据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>已发出</td>\n<td>数据请求已送达</td>\n<td>计划完成度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已响应</td>\n<td>供应商提交了任一形式的回复</td>\n<td>供应商参与度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通过校验</td>\n<td>提交内容通过单位/边界/异常值校验</td>\n<td>真正可用的数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已采纳</td>\n<td>进入披露或聚合计算</td>\n<td>最终口径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「已响应」到「通过校验」之间的损耗往往很大，这个损耗率本身就是供应商数据能力的度量，也是下一轮培训与模板改进的依据。请求生命周期与校验规则的细节见 <a href=\"../scope3-data-aggregation/supplier-scope3-data-collect\">供应链上游 Scope3 数据采集</a> 与 <a href=\"esg-disclosure-calendar-workflow\">ESG 报告日历与跨部门工作流</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"鉴证调整项指标\">鉴证调整项指标</h3><p>用两个数衡量治理成熟度：<strong>调整项总数</strong>与其<strong>复发率</strong>。复发率比总数更重要——同一类问题连续出现说明整改没落到系统里。相关的数据结构（带 <code>recurrence_of</code> 的调整项台账）见 <a href=\"../assurance-governance/limited-reasonable-assurance\">有限保证/合理保证鉴证</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时效指标\">时效指标</h3><p>数据不仅有质量，还有时间。<strong>数据时滞</strong>定义为「活动发生期结束日」到「数据可用的日期」之间的天数。时滞过长意味着数据在鉴证与决策时已经陈旧，且往往与人工传递环节相关。这个指标的道理与范围 2 排放因子的年份滞后类似——过期的数据即使准确也降低决策价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量体系的数据模型\">度量体系的数据模型</h2><h3 id=\"指标快照表\">指标快照表</h3><p>度量本身也要留痕，否则无法比较年度变化。做法是按期快照：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE esg_quality_metric (&#10;  fiscal_year      SMALLINT     NOT NULL,&#10;  snapshot_date    DATE         NOT NULL,&#10;  metric_code      VARCHAR(32)  NOT NULL,   -- &#39;dp_completeness&#39;,&#39;est_share&#39;,&#39;supplier_valid_rate&#39;&#10;  scope_area       VARCHAR(64)  NOT NULL,   -- &#39;scope3_c1&#39;,&#39;social_s2&#39;,&#39;own_ops&#39;,&#39;taxonomy&#39;&#10;  numerator        NUMERIC(20,6),&#10;  denominator      NUMERIC(20,6),&#10;  unit             VARCHAR(16)  NOT NULL,   -- &#39;datapoint&#39;,&#39;tco2e&#39;,&#39;spend_pct&#39;,&#39;entity&#39;&#10;  gap_reason       VARCHAR(24),             -- &#39;not_collected&#39;,&#39;requested_pending&#39;,&#39;not_available&#39;&#10;  target           NUMERIC(20,6),           -- 当年改进目标&#10;  computed_at      TIMESTAMP    NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (fiscal_year, snapshot_date, metric_code, scope_area, gap_reason)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 年度改进对比：哪些范围的缺口在缩小&#10;SELECT scope_area,&#10;       MAX(CASE WHEN fiscal_year = :y   THEN numerator/NULLIF(denominator,0) END) AS cur,&#10;       MAX(CASE WHEN fiscal_year = :y-1 THEN numerator/NULLIF(denominator,0) END) AS prev&#10;FROM esg_quality_metric&#10;WHERE metric_code = &#39;dp_completeness&#39;&#10;GROUP BY scope_area&#10;ORDER BY scope_area;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> esg_quality_metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fiscal_year      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshot_date    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  metric_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'dp_completeness','est_share','supplier_valid_rate'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_area       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'scope3_c1','social_s2','own_ops','taxonomy'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  numerator        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  denominator      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unit             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'datapoint','tco2e','spend_pct','entity'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gap_reason       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'not_collected','requested_pending','not_available'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 当年改进目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  computed_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (fiscal_year, snapshot_date, metric_code, scope_area, gap_reason)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 年度改进对比：哪些范围的缺口在缩小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scope_area,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fiscal_year </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :y   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numerator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(denominator,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fiscal_year </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numerator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(denominator,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> esg_quality_metric</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metric_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dp_completeness'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scope_area</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scope_area;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>gap_reason</code> 放进主键是刻意的：它强制每个缺口被归因，而不是汇总成一个无法行动的百分比。<code>target</code> 字段把度量与改进目标绑在一起，使「完整率 68%」变成「完整率 68%，目标 80%，缺口主要在类别 4 的承运商数据」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分层看板\">分层看板</h3><p>同一批指标在不同层级上的用途不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>关注指标</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行层</td>\n<td>供应商响应率、校验通过率、任务延期</td>\n<td>周/月</td>\n<td>日常推进与催办</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管理层</td>\n<td>完整率、估算占比、覆盖率</td>\n<td>季</td>\n<td>资源分配与风险预警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>治理层</td>\n<td>鉴证调整项、复发率、重述影响</td>\n<td>半年/年</td>\n<td>与审计委员会沟通</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部</td>\n<td>覆盖比例、估算占比、鉴证范围</td>\n<td>年</td>\n<td>披露与问卷作答</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>外部层级要披露的指标通常只有覆盖率与估算占比这两个——它们直接告诉读者数据的可靠程度，见 <a href=\"../assurance-governance/greenwashing-disclosure-risk\">漂绿风险与披露口径管控</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"改进优先级的排序方法\">改进优先级的排序方法</h2><h3 id=\"双因子排序\">双因子排序</h3><p>资源有限，改进顺序需要可计算的依据。两个因子决定优先级：该数据的<strong>重要性</strong>（占排放或采购额的比例）与当前的<strong>质量缺口</strong>。上一篇给出的形式可以推广到全部指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{i} = w_i \\times (1 - q_i) \\times c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是重要性权重（如该类别占总量比例），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是当前质量分（L1 到 L4 映射到 1.0 至 0.25），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是改进可行性（例如是否有现成通道，或供应商是否有能力配合，取值 0 到 1）。加可行性因子是必要的：一个重要性高但短期不可能拿到的数据，不应排在一位而去占用整年的资源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从排序到年度目标\">从排序到年度目标</h3><p>排序的产出不是一串名次，而是<strong>少量可承诺的年度目标</strong>。可行做法是每年只承诺三到五个可验证的提级目标，例如「类别 4 承运商实测数据覆盖率从 30% 提升到 60%」「S2 场址覆盖率从 55% 提升到 75%」。目标要可验证（有明确的分母与阈值）且可归因到具体团队。目标过多会导致全部落空。</p>\n<h3 id=\"目标与衡量口径必须同期冻结\">目标与衡量口径必须同期冻结</h3><p>设定目标时若没有同时锁定衡量口径，年末会出现「按新口径已达标」的辩解。规范做法是把目标与 <code>esg_quality_metric</code> 中的 <code>metric_code</code>、<code>scope_area</code>、<code>unit</code> 一起冻结，见 <a href=\"../assurance-governance/data-lineage-evidence-trace\">ESG 数据血缘、留痕与可追溯</a> 中的口径变更管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量被扭曲的几种方式\">度量被扭曲的几种方式</h2><p>任何被考核的指标都会被优化，ESG 质量指标也不例外。需要预先设防的几种扭曲：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>扭曲方式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>防御</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分母缩水</td>\n<td>把难采的披露点判为「不适用」</td>\n<td>主题矩阵判定须留依据并复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用估算填满</td>\n<td>完整率上去但估算占比同步上升</td>\n<td>完整率必须与估算占比同时考核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只报好算的</td>\n<td>选择易采数据点纳入分母</td>\n<td>分母由主题矩阵生成，不由团队自选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颗粒度上移</td>\n<td>把区域数据报成场址数据</td>\n<td>场址级覆盖率单独考核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时滞掩盖</td>\n<td>用上期数据充当本期</td>\n<td>数据时滞指标单独跟踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这五条对应的是度量设计的一般原则：<strong>任何单一指标都会被优化，因此关键质量维度必须成对考核</strong>。完整率配估算占比、响应率配校验通过率、覆盖率配颗粒度，是这套体系里最重要的三个配对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"闭环-从度量回到任务\">闭环：从度量回到任务</h2><h3 id=\"度量驱动下一年的日历\">度量驱动下一年的日历</h3><p>度量结果应当直接生成下一年的任务模板：低覆盖的类别自动生成采集任务，高时滞的环节自动在日历上提早，复发性的鉴证发现自动转成校验规则。这样年度计划就不是每年重写，而是由上一年的度量演化而来。日历系统的任务与数据绑定机制支持这一点，见 <a href=\"esg-disclosure-calendar-workflow\">ESG 报告日历与跨部门工作流</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"度量的对外价值\">度量的对外价值</h3><p>对外的完整率与覆盖比例本身就是披露内容的一部分，它告诉报告读者哪些数字可靠、哪些是估计。同时它也是评级与客户审核的加分项——CDP 与 EcoVadis 都关注企业是否有系统性的数据管理机制，见 <a href=\"../esg-disclosure-framework/esg-rating-cdp-ecovadis-response\">CDP/EcoVadis 评级与问卷应对</a>。换句话说，<strong>度量的透明化既改善内部管理，也改善外部评价</strong>，两者不冲突。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>度量的核心四问：拿到多少、多少是估算、多少供应商未响应、鉴证调整项是增是减。</li>\n<li>完整率的分母来自主题矩阵裁定的适用披露点；价值链数据用覆盖口径（采购额/场址），自有运营数据用点数口径。</li>\n<li>完整率必须与估算占比成对考核，排放类指标的估算占比按排放量加权而非点数加权。</li>\n<li>供应商指标要区分发出、响应、通过校验、已采纳四态；响应到校验之间的损耗自身就是度量对象。</li>\n<li>缺口必须归因为未采集、已请求未回收、不可得三类，因为三者的动作完全不同。</li>\n<li>改进优先级按「重要性 × 质量缺口 × 可行性」排序，每年只承诺三到五个可验证的提级目标，且目标与口径同期冻结。</li>\n<li>任何被考核的指标都会被优化，因此关键维度必须成对考核（完整率配估算占比、响应率配校验通过率、覆盖率配颗粒度）。</li>\n<li>度量结果应自动生成下一年的任务与校验规则，形成闭环；完整率与覆盖比例的对外披露同时改善内外评价。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ESG 数据完整率/缺口与改进度量","id":"esg-数据完整率-缺口与改进度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心指标的定义","id":"核心指标的定义"},{"level":3,"text":"数据完整率","id":"数据完整率"},{"level":3,"text":"估算占比与数据质量分布","id":"估算占比与数据质量分布"},{"level":3,"text":"供应商响应率","id":"供应商响应率"},{"level":3,"text":"鉴证调整项指标","id":"鉴证调整项指标"},{"level":3,"text":"时效指标","id":"时效指标"},{"level":2,"text":"度量体系的数据模型","id":"度量体系的数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"指标快照表","id":"指标快照表"},{"level":3,"text":"分层看板","id":"分层看板"},{"level":2,"text":"改进优先级的排序方法","id":"改进优先级的排序方法"},{"level":3,"text":"双因子排序","id":"双因子排序"},{"level":3,"text":"从排序到年度目标","id":"从排序到年度目标"},{"level":3,"text":"目标与衡量口径必须同期冻结","id":"目标与衡量口径必须同期冻结"},{"level":2,"text":"度量被扭曲的几种方式","id":"度量被扭曲的几种方式"},{"level":2,"text":"闭环：从度量回到任务","id":"闭环-从度量回到任务"},{"level":3,"text":"度量驱动下一年的日历","id":"度量驱动下一年的日历"},{"level":3,"text":"度量的对外价值","id":"度量的对外价值"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"绿色金融/大客户审核数据传导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/esg-scope3-sustainability-reporting/esg-report-ops/green-finance-buyer-audit-transmit"},"next":null}